 "brief": "The Gaza Crossings and Borders Authority announced Tuesday that 32 Palestinians departed through the Rafah land crossing, Shehab Wire reported. The group included 15 patients requiring medical treatment outside the enclave.\n\nThe Rafah crossing, Gaza's primary exit point to Egypt, has served as a critical passage for Palestinians seeking medical care and travel abroad amid the territory's ongoing humanitarian crisis.",
